<title>JAPAN: TABLE-Japan June jobless rate stays at record high.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Japan June jobless rate stays at record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's seasonally adjusted unemployment rate  stood at 3.5 percent in June, unchanged from the record high set in  May, the government's Management and Coordination Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>The jobs-to-applicants ratio rose to 0.74 in June from 0.73 the previous  month, the Labour Ministry announced separately.</p>
<p>That means there were 74 openings for every 100 job seekers.</p>
</text>
